<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.8500 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.8500 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.8500 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8450 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  March 28	   March 27</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8500	     1.8450</p>
<p> Volume traded			$14.29 million	 $1.30 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
